WEBVTT

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:38.090
<b>A</b>

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:38.090
His tail swept down a third of the stars of heaven,
and cast them to the earth.
And the dragon stood before the woman,
who was about to bear a child,
that he might devour her child when she brought it forth.

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:01.220
She moved just as the data predicted.

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:04.750
Target acquired.
Target acquired.{What the hell language is that? Not English, and I don't think Japanese}

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:09.550
All ES.W.A.T. Units secure area for recovery and immediate dust off.

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:12.510
Key groups on target confrontation.{Okay, that is English}

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:16.700
Target acquired.
Target acquired.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:21.570
All ES.W.A.T. Units secure area for recovery and immediate dust off.

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:24.620
-- Key groups on target confrontation.

00:07:22.180 --> 00:07:23.840
-- Step aside!

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:40.420
The trouble with these sedative rounds is that they leave marks on the body.

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:46.680
That's her.
We've secured Deunan Knute.

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:56.310
She's beautiful.

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:46.720
8 hours, 12 minutes...

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:48.290
She's sleeping well.

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:53.620
The legendary soldier looks
cute when she's asleep.

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:58.430
Does she know about your body?

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:05.670
Well, she's in for a surprise when she wakes up...

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:07.890
...and she sees our utopia.

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.610
Utopia, huh?

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:14.220
Olympus AF5, do we have landing clearance yet?

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:20.210
Don't get too close till they confirm our ID.

00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:23.130
Those Mobile Fortress platforms will fill us full of holes otherwise.

00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:25.410
-- Olympus AF5, this is...

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:26.610
-- G2E9, landing permitted.

00:09:26.610 --> 00:09:28.630
Landing clearance confirmed.

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:32.220
ES.W.A.T. G2E9, we are preparing to land.

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:20.070
Briareos!

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:21.770
I'm going to scout around ahead.

00:11:21.770 --> 00:11:22.770
I'll go with you!

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:24.860
You stay here.

00:11:26.970 --> 00:11:29.220
Relax! I'll be back before you know it!

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:33.150
Briareos...

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:08.850
I see you ran a thorough check on this one.

00:12:08.850 --> 00:12:10.570
Just following orders from the Legislature.

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:13.520
She's still asleep.

00:12:14.450 --> 00:12:17.080
I wonder if we gave her the wrong dosage of the anesthesia?

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:33.300
One move and I'll snap your neck!

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:54.650
Second Platoon Leader Deunan Knute, stand down at once!

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:56.470
Briareos?

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:21.430
I don't believe it.

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:25.430
I don't blame you, but it's true.

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:29.410
You're saying that after that
massive world war,

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:31.440
nobody ended up winning it?

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:35.100
Right, and now the former General Administration Agency

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:38.940
more or less governs the world from here in Olympus.

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:45.450
So, I've been fighting meaningless battle after battle for months, without knowing anything.

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:47.470
That's war for you.

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:51.150
But it's different here.

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:55.260
In Olympus, humanity has finally achieved utopia.

00:13:56.670 --> 00:13:58.680
Why was I brought here?

00:13:58.680 --> 00:14:02.180
Because you're an excellent soldier.

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:06.700
Your name's at the top of the ES.W.A.T. personnel reinforcement list.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:13.270
My job is to bring chosen soldiers, like yourself, from the outside world here to Olympus.

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:15.280
ES.W.A.T.?

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:20.400
I'm sure you have a ton of questions, but get some sleep tonight.

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:25.830
We'll pick all this up tomorrow, and I'll show you around the city.

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:29.450
I'm sure you're going to like our utopia.

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:35.710
The bedroom's in here.

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:38.390
It must be ages since you slept in a soft bed.

00:14:39.150 --> 00:14:41.170
I'll pick you up tomorrow morning at 10:00.

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:44.930
Your name's Hitomi, right?

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:47.510
That's right.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:49.850
Have we met before?

00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:53.270
No, now, goodnight.

00:15:07.250 --> 00:15:08.640
When did...

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:11.700
It was on the North African front.

00:15:12.370 --> 00:15:13.710
I lost my body there.

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:15.710
It's been a year.

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:27.840
It's Carl's.

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:32.200
A memento of your father, right?

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:34.390
Don't let it get confiscated.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:44.160
Call if you need me.

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:46.420
Briareos?

00:15:48.020 --> 00:15:51.020
Any idea who those guys were who attacked me?

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:54.260
None.

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:11.770
How sad.

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:17.620
That attack was your doing, wasn't it, Athena?

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:25.260
Money-grubbing mercenaries are surely no threat to ES.W.A.T.

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:29.760
Have you forgotten the Bioroid mission?

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:31.910
If the military authority finds out,

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:34.760
it will play right into General Uranus's hands.

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:39.190
He's beyond our control now.

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:42.810
And Gaia may be at its limit.

00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:48.470
Athena, we haven't much time left.

00:17:56.460 --> 00:18:00.170
<b>Administrative House</b>

00:17:58.520 --> 00:17:59.920
Nike!

00:18:06.740 --> 00:18:07.920
We have a leak.

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:09.710
I apologize for that.

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:15.320
Nike, we need an internal investigation of ES.W.A.T.

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:17.390
I'll arrange it at once.

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:19.850
Luckily, we averted a total disaster.

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:25.650
They didn't find what we were looking for.

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:26.850
Then, you mean...

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:31.030
Nothing rash was done like forcing a surgical probe.

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:37.000
However, we can't leave these sparks to smolder forever.

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:41.560
Make sure I have Deunan Knute.

00:18:41.560 --> 00:18:42.520
Yes, ma'am.

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:55.730
Humanity is a strange creature, so willing to cage itself.

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:26.100
It's an honor to have you come here in person, Colonel Hades.

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:30.670
ES.W.A.T. is knocking themselves out chasing a dummy as we speak.

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:37.660
We're 98% ready at this moment, sir.

00:19:42.170 --> 00:19:43.840
Magnificent...

00:19:44.590 --> 00:19:52.110
We were careful to cover all traces of evidence from these special parts.

00:19:54.570 --> 00:19:57.330
General Uranus will be pleased.

00:20:02.960 --> 00:20:07.620
We won't let the Bioroids have their way any longer!

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:17.370
Our goal here is to protect the sheep, not the wolves, is it not?

00:20:13.390 --> 00:20:19.310
<b>Legislative House</b>

00:20:17.370 --> 00:20:21.730
First generation Bioroids have insufficient constraints.

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:27.500
They're the proverbial wolf in sheep's clothing.

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:33.870
Whether wolf or sheep, even one victim cannot be allowed.

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:35.400
How unfortunate.

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:39.410
Gaia has rendered its decision.{Not sure Gaia is directly refered to here}

00:20:39.890 --> 00:20:44.410
All the more reason to continue the debate.

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:49.670
Now then, let us resume our consultation with Gaia.

00:21:14.060 --> 00:21:14.970
Deunan!

00:21:21.690 --> 00:21:22.970
Briareos!

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:00.320
Good morning, Deunan!

00:22:13.920 --> 00:22:15.830
Looks good on you.

00:22:15.830 --> 00:22:16.990
Get in.

00:22:26.120 --> 00:22:28.920
Your official immigration papers were finalized this morning.

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:32.310
You are now a citizen of Olympus.

00:22:36.400 --> 00:22:38.140
Beautiful city, isn't it?

00:22:38.940 --> 00:22:41.760
Considering where I was until yesterday,

00:22:41.760 --> 00:22:43.320
this is like a mirage.

00:22:43.780 --> 00:22:45.770
Starting today, it's reality.

00:22:45.770 --> 00:22:47.830
Everyone seems happy.

00:22:48.000 --> 00:22:51.490
Because half the population
of the city are Bioroids.

00:22:51.490 --> 00:22:52.330
Bioroids?

00:22:52.780 --> 00:22:54.210
Artificially-generated humans.

00:22:54.210 --> 00:22:55.340
You mean clones?

00:22:55.560 --> 00:22:57.060
Not simple clones.

00:22:57.060 --> 00:23:01.130
Advanced composite hybrids made with the highest qualities.

00:23:01.370 --> 00:23:05.140
So, it's just clones who run this city?

00:23:05.140 --> 00:23:07.640
Pardon me, but "Just clones"?

00:23:07.640 --> 00:23:10.050
I happen to be a Bioroid, too.{And it just adds to your charm ^_^}

00:23:11.430 --> 00:23:16.570
And while we may be made from superior elements, Bioroids don't control humans.

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:19.610
Our role is to be a stabilizing force on human society.

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:23.070
We act as a sort of buffer between humans.

00:23:24.320 --> 00:23:26.830
Half are Bioroids...

00:23:34.130 --> 00:23:35.840
This car seems sort of strange.

00:23:36.180 --> 00:23:39.810
It has an experimental Damysos system installed.

00:23:39.810 --> 00:23:40.590
Damysos?

00:23:41.450 --> 00:23:43.520
In short, a floating car.

00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:45.520
Live long enough, you'll see everything.

00:23:45.520 --> 00:23:48.670
They've achieved gravity control through
ultra-high frequency oscillation?!

00:23:49.150 --> 00:23:51.510
And all you do to control it is steer with that wheel?

00:23:51.970 --> 00:23:55.730
Everything in this city, down to this car, has cyborg senses.

00:23:55.730 --> 00:23:59.740
The basis of all design here is to make it human-centered.

00:24:00.680 --> 00:24:06.520
"Simple concepts, complex structures, maximum humanity."

00:24:06.520 --> 00:24:07.570
Right?

00:24:08.360 --> 00:24:09.540
What's that?

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:12.530
The words from the Central Management Bureau to the Maintenance Department.

00:24:13.250 --> 00:24:16.150
And there's the symbol of it.

00:24:17.930 --> 00:24:19.900
Tartaros and Daidalos.{At first I was like "wait, it's Tartarus and Daedalus". But then I looked it up and these are actually correct Greek transliterations of the names. I guess it just depends on who you ask whether they use Greek or Latin. I'm too lazy to put it back to the Latin transliterations}

00:24:19.900 --> 00:24:24.970
The enormous IN Brain inside runs Olympus.

00:24:25.400 --> 00:24:26.300
IN?

00:24:26.680 --> 00:24:29.550
Intelligent Network...

00:24:29.550 --> 00:24:31.130
It's nicknamed Gaia.

00:24:31.130 --> 00:24:35.770
Gaia is a self-expanding network that monitors everything in Olympus.

00:24:36.650 --> 00:24:39.270
Particularly us Bioroids.

00:24:39.500 --> 00:24:41.060
Why is that?

00:24:41.060 --> 00:24:44.160
Look, human emotions tend to be unstable, right?

00:24:44.160 --> 00:24:47.250
Humans are quick to anger and go to war,

00:24:47.250 --> 00:24:50.460
but Bioroid emotions are suppressed.

00:24:50.460 --> 00:24:53.770
We don't get jealous or bitter towards other people.

00:24:54.320 --> 00:24:56.960
That's how we prevent wars from starting.

00:24:57.480 --> 00:25:04.180
But at the top of Tartaros is a virus tank called the D-Tank which is guarded by the ultimate security system.

00:25:04.180 --> 00:25:08.980
They say that if it's ever activated, it would wipe out all the Bioroids.

00:25:08.980 --> 00:25:11.730
I know it's just the result of the natural human instinct for self-preservation,

00:25:11.730 --> 00:25:13.970
but I find it rather insulting.

00:25:14.130 --> 00:25:16.420
Meaning humans are the more likely threat?

00:25:16.420 --> 00:25:19.530
That's why it's vital we maintain balance between us.

00:25:20.180 --> 00:25:24.400
Gaia maintains a watch on the emotional impact Bioroids have on humans.

00:25:24.610 --> 00:25:27.450
In other words, it keeps an eye on the humans.

00:25:27.450 --> 00:25:29.680
You sound like General Uranus.

00:25:29.680 --> 00:25:30.650
Who?

00:25:30.960 --> 00:25:33.730
The commander of the Olympus Regular Army.

00:25:33.730 --> 00:25:37.900
He's an extreme reactionary who hates Bioroids.

00:25:37.900 --> 00:25:40.670
Doesn't take to utopia, huh?

00:25:40.670 --> 00:25:44.580
Olympus is run entirely by Bioroids.

00:25:44.580 --> 00:25:46.980
Prime Minister Athena is a Bioroid as well.

00:25:46.980 --> 00:25:48.120
Athena?

00:25:49.590 --> 00:25:50.680
Athena...

00:25:50.680 --> 00:25:52.520
You know Prime Minister Athena?

00:25:53.730 --> 00:25:55.930
I doubt it, but...

00:25:57.220 --> 00:26:00.180
She's like a president.

00:26:00.180 --> 00:26:02.740
But humans run the military.

00:26:02.740 --> 00:26:04.050
Scary, huh?

00:26:04.890 --> 00:26:09.970
Lately, with Prime Minister Athena running ES.W.A.T. under the authority of the Administration,

00:26:09.970 --> 00:26:11.940
it's become an army in its own form.

00:26:11.940 --> 00:26:14.920
And it isn't winning her any friends with the regular army.

00:26:15.860 --> 00:26:21.060
But final decision-making authority over Olympus is entrusted to Gaia.

00:26:22.080 --> 00:26:22.880
What's wrong?

00:26:23.370 --> 00:26:24.470
We're being followed.

00:27:19.090 --> 00:27:20.750
You okay, Hitomi?

00:27:20.750 --> 00:27:23.250
I think so, but look there.

00:27:29.900 --> 00:27:32.300
Not a terribly friendly-looking bunch.

00:27:32.300 --> 00:27:34.450
So, are they after me?

00:27:34.450 --> 00:27:35.440
Definitely.

00:27:35.440 --> 00:27:37.720
I knew this was reality after all.

00:28:18.880 --> 00:28:20.170
Briareos!

00:29:38.440 --> 00:29:42.160
The Appleseed seal must not be broken.

00:30:07.110 --> 00:30:09.640
How are you feeling, Elders?

00:30:09.930 --> 00:30:12.810
Hitomi, you're safe!

00:30:12.970 --> 00:30:14.810
Are you injured?

00:30:15.690 --> 00:30:17.490
l'm fine.

00:30:17.490 --> 00:30:21.390
Anyway, here's the one you've been waiting for: Deunan Knute.

00:30:25.400 --> 00:30:28.200
As beautiful as rumored.

00:30:28.200 --> 00:30:29.760
The goddess of war.

00:30:29.760 --> 00:30:32.970
You definitely have Carl's eyes.

00:30:32.970 --> 00:30:35.010
You knew my father?

00:30:35.360 --> 00:30:37.500
Everything about him.

00:30:37.500 --> 00:30:44.560
Most Bioroids in Olympus carry some of the genes of Colonel Carl Knute.

00:30:44.560 --> 00:30:49.070
That makes you and Hitomi something like sisters.

00:30:49.670 --> 00:30:52.190
Anyway, we're sorry to hear you had a terrible experience

00:30:52.190 --> 00:30:54.060
so soon after arriving here.

00:30:54.060 --> 00:31:00.240
There's been a lot of resentment towards outsiders lately.

00:31:00.720 --> 00:31:03.940
They fear the balance of their society has been upset.

00:31:05.320 --> 00:31:09.430
First of all, let us introduce you to Gaia.

00:31:30.940 --> 00:31:33.050
There's been some excitement.

00:31:33.050 --> 00:31:35.530
The Legislature and the Administration are at odds.

00:31:35.530 --> 00:31:38.650
It's more proof of the growing arrogance of the Bioroids.

00:31:39.680 --> 00:31:43.310
You're certain Athena is searching for Carl's daughter?

00:31:43.310 --> 00:31:44.660
Without a doubt, sir.

00:31:46.030 --> 00:31:48.360
Everything's ready, sir.

00:31:48.360 --> 00:31:50.470
How reliable is our intelligence?

00:31:50.470 --> 00:31:52.420
Level 5, sir.

00:31:53.880 --> 00:31:56.310
Your decision, General?

00:32:01.230 --> 00:32:04.470
I won't allow humans to become living tools.

00:32:18.580 --> 00:32:20.610
This is Gaia...

00:32:23.070 --> 00:32:30.490
Gaia is the self-expanding network which administers Olympus.

00:32:30.870 --> 00:32:35.420
Debate between Gaia and the Elders here produces the will of Olympus.

00:32:36.150 --> 00:32:42.790
Gaia is a collection of the wisdom and intentions of the scientists who designed it.

00:32:42.790 --> 00:32:47.090
But, in the end, a machine is a machine.
It's perfectly stable.

00:32:47.570 --> 00:32:49.840
It doesn't waver at all.

00:32:49.840 --> 00:32:54.600
In short, it has no feelings or emotions.

00:32:55.130 --> 00:33:03.900
By adding our seven human souls, we give Gaia its flexibility.

00:33:04.490 --> 00:33:07.700
Although, lately, you've been disagreeing with it a lot.

00:33:08.580 --> 00:33:14.370
Our job is to ensure an ongoing dialogue with Gaia.

00:33:14.370 --> 00:33:22.200
The results of our long discussions set Olympus on the proper path towards the future.

00:33:23.060 --> 00:33:27.370
Until yesterday, you were on the battlefield, weren't you, Deunan?

00:33:27.370 --> 00:33:30.810
What were you fighting for?

00:33:33.180 --> 00:33:34.850
Well...

00:33:35.190 --> 00:33:41.000
So long as humans continue to have desires, war will never end.

00:33:41.000 --> 00:33:45.510
That is why we built Olympus.

00:33:46.430 --> 00:33:49.770
Coexistence between Man and Bioroid

00:33:49.770 --> 00:33:53.180
is the last hope for Mankind.

00:33:54.270 --> 00:33:58.000
Gaia monitors that balance.

00:33:58.760 --> 00:34:03.150
Bioroids are vastly different life forms from humans.

00:34:03.150 --> 00:34:07.600
Bioroids cannot reproduce,
so they can have no descendants.

00:34:08.370 --> 00:34:10.350
Which means, no sex.{Actually, they can still fuck; they just can't have babies}

00:34:10.350 --> 00:34:18.640
And since the emotion of love is controlled, desires are minimized and hatred weakened.

00:34:18.640 --> 00:34:30.370
However, Bioroids need to undergo a periodic life extension process, or they will age rapidly and die.

00:34:31.660 --> 00:34:42.960
In order to differentiate Bioroids from humans, we suppressed the reproductive functions and changed their life cycle.{God damn these guys talk so fucking slow...}

00:34:43.230 --> 00:34:49.220
Hitomi, aren't you overdue for a life extension yourself?

00:34:49.490 --> 00:34:53.210
Don't worry, I'll get it done in the next few days.

00:34:53.420 --> 00:34:58.640
Someday, I pray you won't have to go through all this trouble.

00:35:58.950 --> 00:36:02.820
Kudoh, your team's been wiped out.

00:36:10.630 --> 00:36:12.830
You're all pretty green.
Nothing personal, guys.

00:36:18.620 --> 00:36:23.350
She started with one knife and killed sixteen men in ten minutes.

00:36:24.260 --> 00:36:26.680
That's one amazing rookie you've brought me.{I hate the word "helluva". It's not even a word. Use "hell of a" next time. Or better yet, just translate it litterally as "amazing".}

00:36:35.380 --> 00:36:37.170
Proud of yourself?

00:36:40.520 --> 00:36:44.990
Your life may depend on those men someday.

00:36:44.990 --> 00:36:47.170
You can show them a little more respect.

00:36:54.240 --> 00:36:57.760
Is that all you have to say after we've been apart for so long?!

00:37:09.570 --> 00:37:12.140
Can't you say something nice to me, at least?!

00:37:13.100 --> 00:37:15.440
Like, "How've you been for the last two years?"

00:37:15.440 --> 00:37:17.110
Or, "It's great to see you again!"

00:37:17.420 --> 00:37:19.120
Someone's after you.

00:37:19.120 --> 00:37:20.490
I know that!

00:37:20.950 --> 00:37:23.320
But why?! Who's behind it?!

00:37:24.310 --> 00:37:25.420
I don't know.

00:37:25.420 --> 00:37:27.490
Then what's Appleseed?

00:37:27.490 --> 00:37:28.620
I don't know.

00:37:28.620 --> 00:37:31.290
Stop answering me like a machine!

00:37:36.140 --> 00:37:37.380
I'm sorry...

00:37:47.250 --> 00:37:49.930
My duty now is to protect you.

00:37:51.720 --> 00:37:53.560
Your duty?

00:37:53.980 --> 00:37:55.720
See you tomorrow at 9.

00:38:35.840 --> 00:38:37.480
-- Well, cheers!

00:38:36.770 --> 00:38:37.980
-- Cheers!

00:38:39.100 --> 00:38:44.010
I never thought you were Deunan Knute, the legendary lady warrior.

00:38:45.020 --> 00:38:46.660
I heard you were killed in the war.

00:38:46.660 --> 00:38:50.350
Everyone talks about your exploits in the Conventional War.

00:38:56.580 --> 00:38:58.760
May I join you?

00:39:00.060 --> 00:39:01.150
Go ahead.

00:39:03.150 --> 00:39:06.170
Deunan, about Carl Knute...

00:39:07.080 --> 00:39:08.770
Where's your father now?

00:39:09.250 --> 00:39:11.560
He died of an illness before the war.

00:39:11.560 --> 00:39:12.690
I see...

00:39:13.670 --> 00:39:14.800
And your mother?

00:39:14.800 --> 00:39:17.320
I don't remember her at all.

00:39:17.320 --> 00:39:19.730
Dad never spoke about her.

00:39:24.240 --> 00:39:28.410
You and Briareos were lovers once, weren't you?

00:39:28.890 --> 00:39:32.250
That was back when he was still flesh and blood.

00:39:32.250 --> 00:39:35.290
Looks count for a lot in love, don't they?

00:39:35.290 --> 00:39:37.250
I didn't say that!

00:39:37.250 --> 00:39:38.920
What a waste, then.

00:39:38.920 --> 00:39:40.910
He's still a man inside, you know.

00:39:44.900 --> 00:39:46.080
Hey...

00:39:48.390 --> 00:39:50.840
How does it feel to be in love?

00:39:51.650 --> 00:39:56.070
Remember we told you that feelings of love are controlled in Bioroids?

00:39:56.070 --> 00:39:58.400
That's why we don't know what it feels like to be "in love."

00:39:59.430 --> 00:40:05.190
I have an abstract understanding of it, but not an emotional one.

00:40:06.870 --> 00:40:10.520
That's what makes it so fascinating to me.

00:40:11.880 --> 00:40:16.390
It's one thing I envy about humans.

00:40:20.470 --> 00:40:22.950
What's it like to be in love?

00:40:25.310 --> 00:40:27.600
To love somebody...

00:40:31.000 --> 00:40:32.560
Why, you...!

00:40:32.560 --> 00:40:36.570
-- How dare you speak to a human that way, Bioroid?!

00:40:34.640 --> 00:40:35.750
-- My apologies.

00:40:36.820 --> 00:40:39.380
-- Oh, talking back to me now?!

00:40:37.630 --> 00:40:39.780
-- Olympus Regular Army.

00:40:39.380 --> 00:40:41.230
-- Come on, say something else!

00:40:39.780 --> 00:40:41.230
-- It's terrible.

00:40:41.230 --> 00:40:43.270
Humans start shouting so easily.

00:40:43.270 --> 00:40:44.720
Can't you say anything now?!

00:41:34.340 --> 00:41:36.130
Operation inspection complete.

00:41:36.130 --> 00:41:37.800
No problems.

00:41:38.420 --> 00:41:41.120
Now, to adjust the cockpit seat.

00:41:41.750 --> 00:41:44.480
I just want to clear up a question first.

00:41:44.480 --> 00:41:47.220
Why so few cushions or shock absorbers in the tendon sheath?

00:41:47.760 --> 00:41:53.090
As I explained before, shock is absorbed in the power train.

00:41:53.730 --> 00:41:56.640
But there are plenty of cartilage units.

00:41:56.640 --> 00:42:02.020
Magnetic fluid parts are used in the tri-axial joints, the bearings and the fine sensory oscillation control.

00:42:02.710 --> 00:42:05.990
Don't get too wild out there, or you may dislocate something.

00:42:05.990 --> 00:42:09.440
Yoshitsune, you don't need to worry too much about Deunan Knute.

00:42:09.440 --> 00:42:14.240
But you don't usually see women mastering a Landmate like this.

00:42:14.690 --> 00:42:17.340
Okay, let's adjust the seat so I can operate it.

00:42:30.370 --> 00:42:34.560
Deunan, Yoshitsune is the best mechanic in Olympus.

00:42:34.920 --> 00:42:36.800
As far as Landmates are concerned.

00:42:37.250 --> 00:42:40.510
Right now, he's really into Hecatonchires cyborgs.

00:42:40.510 --> 00:42:42.310
You got to let me have a look inside you one day!

00:42:43.090 --> 00:42:45.090
I'm kinda shy.

00:42:45.090 --> 00:42:46.330
I'll pass on that.

00:42:57.950 --> 00:42:58.970
Got it locked down?

00:42:58.970 --> 00:43:00.290
Mm-hmm, I'm fine.

00:43:00.290 --> 00:43:03.830
Okay, then, first of all, this is the starter switch.

00:43:10.770 --> 00:43:13.460
Start out slow and get used to it.

00:43:13.920 --> 00:43:15.130
Good, good.

00:43:27.860 --> 00:43:30.900
State of emergency!
Scramble order!

00:43:34.240 --> 00:43:34.910
What is it?

00:43:34.910 --> 00:43:36.660
That's an emergency scramble alarm!

00:43:42.140 --> 00:43:46.790
Multiple unidentified Landmates have raided the Bioroid Care Center.

00:43:46.790 --> 00:43:50.080
ES.W.A.T. Units 104, 106, 107!

00:43:50.080 --> 00:43:54.390
Employ Landmates with D-type load out and get to the scene at once!

00:43:54.390 --> 00:43:59.850
Repeat, multiple unidentified Landmates have raided the Bioroid Care Center.

00:43:59.850 --> 00:44:02.810
ES.W.A.T. Units 104, 106, 107!

00:44:03.130 --> 00:44:05.810
Don't just stand there! Come on!

00:44:06.430 --> 00:44:08.290
Never mind! I'll go in this!

00:44:08.290 --> 00:44:09.600
In that?!

00:44:12.490 --> 00:44:13.580
Deunan!

00:45:09.270 --> 00:45:10.510
Stop!

00:45:21.050 --> 00:45:21.940
Here they come...

00:45:48.360 --> 00:45:49.550
How do I aim?

00:46:02.700 --> 00:46:03.870
Deunan!

00:46:19.890 --> 00:46:21.290
Wait! No!

00:46:37.620 --> 00:46:38.820
Come out of there!

00:47:06.490 --> 00:47:07.420
Deunan!

00:47:35.060 --> 00:47:36.260
Briareos!

00:47:50.280 --> 00:47:51.400
I'm sorry.

00:48:17.640 --> 00:48:19.310
How could they have done this foolish thing?!

00:48:19.960 --> 00:48:22.550
All 3rd Generation Bioroids have been destroyed.

00:48:23.310 --> 00:48:27.370
All original life-extension DNA was lost in the fire as well.

00:48:27.680 --> 00:48:31.300
They entered from an underground elevator shaft.

00:48:31.300 --> 00:48:34.540
Then, one by one, they cleared all seven security points.

00:48:35.500 --> 00:48:38.410
There's no trace that the attackers came from outside of Olympus.

00:48:38.410 --> 00:48:40.540
Landmate origin is unknown.

00:48:41.960 --> 00:48:43.770
I never thought they'd go this far.

00:48:44.760 --> 00:48:50.430
It seems to be our destiny to bear the original sins of mankind.

00:48:50.840 --> 00:48:53.250
We're out of options now.

00:48:55.080 --> 00:48:58.560
Seal off the perimeter of Tartaros and Daidalos at once.

00:48:59.370 --> 00:49:02.810
Don't let anyone near the D-Tank!

00:49:02.810 --> 00:49:03.670
Yes, ma'am.

00:49:03.670 --> 00:49:05.820
Convene an emergency assembly at once.{THIS IS SCREAMING!!}

00:49:10.020 --> 00:49:12.420
I hope Deunan's okay.

00:49:13.480 --> 00:49:15.140
Hitomi!

00:49:16.480 --> 00:49:17.760
Don't tell me...

00:49:21.730 --> 00:49:25.560
You're three days over your extension deadline!

00:49:25.560 --> 00:49:26.930
Hitomi?

00:49:26.930 --> 00:49:28.130
Hitomi!

00:49:28.760 --> 00:49:30.590
Hitomi... Hitomi!

00:49:38.390 --> 00:49:44.780
We haven't identified the Landmates which attacked the Care Center or where they were built.

00:49:45.230 --> 00:49:49.780
That's the extent of the information about the incident ES.W.A.T. has at this time.

00:49:50.020 --> 00:49:54.780
I urge all Bioroids to remain calm.

00:49:55.560 --> 00:49:59.890
We are discussing alternative life extension methods.

00:50:00.800 --> 00:50:04.560
Above all, do not panic.

00:50:04.560 --> 00:50:06.800
Prime Minister Athena!

00:50:07.230 --> 00:50:14.060
Doesn't sealing off Tartaros and Daidalos by ES.W.A.T. exceed your authority?

00:50:15.600 --> 00:50:19.390
Please understand that this emergency calls for near-martial law conditions.

00:50:19.390 --> 00:50:22.570
We have a duty to protect Gaia.

00:50:22.890 --> 00:50:24.780
Don't you mean the D-Tank?

00:50:25.890 --> 00:50:28.040
To protect <i>Gaia</i>.

00:50:29.850 --> 00:50:32.280
And to ignore the Olympus Regular Army?

00:50:33.310 --> 00:50:35.620
I deemed it the appropriate choice.

00:50:36.100 --> 00:50:37.700
What do you mean?!

00:50:38.230 --> 00:50:40.290
Are you trying to insult us?!

00:50:40.290 --> 00:50:44.180
We don't have time to argue this.

00:50:45.650 --> 00:50:47.460
Everyone,

00:50:47.460 --> 00:50:53.800
this terrorist act attempted to undermine the basis of Bioroid survival

00:50:53.800 --> 00:50:57.270
and is a disaster that has rocked Olympus to its foundations.

00:50:57.940 --> 00:51:05.410
As it now stands, the future for the Bioroid race has been cut off completely.

00:51:05.980 --> 00:51:16.270
However, there remains one way to save them and free Olympus from this crisis.

00:51:16.270 --> 00:51:27.440
For many hours now, we've discussed the pros and cons of this method with Gaia.{Damnit he talks so slow!}

00:51:28.310 --> 00:51:34.060
And now Gaia has made its decision.

00:51:35.850 --> 00:51:44.120
Gaia has ordered the restoration of Bioroid reproductive functions.

00:51:58.150 --> 00:52:03.930
It's my understanding that the technology to restore Bioroid reproductive functions vanished

00:52:03.930 --> 00:52:09.470
when its inventor, Dr. Gilliam, destroyed the original data.

00:52:10.340 --> 00:52:13.380
That is correct, General Uranus.

00:52:13.380 --> 00:52:20.480
It would be impossible, if that original data had truly been destroyed.

00:52:20.480 --> 00:52:31.030
However, we have learned that the data, which we have named "Appleseed," does still exist.

00:52:31.750 --> 00:52:38.510
We are close to recovering this long lost Appleseed.

00:52:38.510 --> 00:52:43.420
Once we do, we'll restore Bioroid reproductive capabilities

00:52:43.420 --> 00:52:47.190
and evolve them into a new race of man

00:52:47.190 --> 00:52:51.020
to create a new paradise!

00:53:04.460 --> 00:53:05.720
Hitomi!

00:53:14.140 --> 00:53:16.750
Don't worry, she's just sleeping.

00:53:17.460 --> 00:53:19.200
Can you really save her?

00:53:19.400 --> 00:53:22.870
If we find the lost Appleseed data.

00:53:23.380 --> 00:53:24.880
And if you don't?

00:53:25.330 --> 00:53:30.670
Then, she'll begin to age rapidly and die within 24 hours.

00:53:32.950 --> 00:53:34.720
It's not just Hitomi.

00:53:35.660 --> 00:53:39.830
That's the fate awaiting all of us Bioroids.

00:53:44.620 --> 00:53:47.350
I'm Prime Minister Athena Areios.

00:53:48.020 --> 00:53:49.460
You must be Deunan Knute.

00:53:52.320 --> 00:53:57.200
Deunan, have you heard of Dr. Gilliam?

00:53:57.720 --> 00:53:58.700
No.

00:53:59.070 --> 00:54:08.670
We've been conducting research for twenty years now,
and have yet to surpass the late Dr. Gilliam's achievements.

00:54:08.840 --> 00:54:18.490
But if we can acquire the Appleseed data that Dr. Gilliam developed, Bioroids will regain the ability to reproduce.

00:54:18.490 --> 00:54:25.350
They'll be freed from the fear of the D-Tank, and become a new, eternal race of mankind.

00:54:28.800 --> 00:54:31.720
Gaia has made its decision.

00:54:33.050 --> 00:54:36.070
Now then, Athena...

00:54:37.080 --> 00:54:39.370
It's time you made yours.

00:54:48.620 --> 00:54:53.180
Deunan, we need your help.

00:55:15.790 --> 00:55:18.600
This old disk is our only clue.

00:55:20.080 --> 00:55:24.240
So, we're headed for the lab where the first Bioroid was created?

00:55:24.240 --> 00:55:25.620
That's what they told me.

00:55:26.130 --> 00:55:30.130
So, why has Prime Minister Athena kept the disk secret all this time?

00:55:34.540 --> 00:55:40.090
And why did Dr. Gilliam seal away the data on Bioroid reproduction?

00:55:40.620 --> 00:55:45.470
Deunan, this is a highly classified and dangerous mission.

00:55:46.460 --> 00:55:52.780
If focusing ourselves on achieving it will save Hitomi's life, isn't that enough?

00:55:53.810 --> 00:55:56.150
Don't distract yourself with anything else.

00:55:56.790 --> 00:55:59.100
Can I ask one more question?

00:55:59.730 --> 00:56:00.730
Sure.

00:56:01.750 --> 00:56:06.150
That last shot you fired at the terrorists, was it...

00:56:06.750 --> 00:56:07.950
No...

00:56:07.950 --> 00:56:10.090
Never mind, forget it.

00:58:14.260 --> 00:58:16.380
Deunan, Leyton, over here!

00:58:21.110 --> 00:58:23.240
This definitely looks like it.

00:58:23.240 --> 00:58:24.660
Kudoh, step back.

00:59:00.660 --> 00:59:04.460
Dr. Gilliam, there's no time!
You have to get out of here!

00:59:04.460 --> 00:59:08.790
Just a little longer, Athena.
I have to destroy this.

00:59:09.860 --> 00:59:13.220
We're holding them off on the first floor. Just hurry!

00:59:23.120 --> 00:59:24.690
Mama!

00:59:28.000 --> 00:59:30.680
What's wrong? Did we wake you?

00:59:40.150 --> 00:59:41.510
No way...

00:59:42.880 --> 00:59:44.140
What is it, Deunan?

00:59:47.930 --> 00:59:49.160
Mom...

01:00:10.440 --> 01:00:13.070
Deunan, listen carefully.

01:00:13.860 --> 01:00:18.970
Mama has recorded some very important research data in this pendant.

01:00:20.150 --> 01:00:26.530
But some bad people want to use it to do bad things.

01:00:26.530 --> 01:00:30.930
That's why I'm hiding it in this.

01:00:31.450 --> 01:00:32.960
Bad people?

01:00:33.130 --> 01:00:34.170
Right.

01:00:34.630 --> 01:00:38.590
Bad people who want to take your future away from you.{She says "duenan-tachi", implying that it is Duenan and everyone else, but I'm at a loss for rewording it}

01:00:39.480 --> 01:00:43.310
That's why I'm giving you this pendant to protect.

01:00:44.880 --> 01:00:47.240
Mmm, I'll protect it.

01:00:48.480 --> 01:00:49.640
Good girl.

01:00:59.730 --> 01:01:04.820
But Deunan, if Athena ever asks for the pendant,

01:01:04.820 --> 01:01:07.790
I want you to give it to her.

01:01:08.760 --> 01:01:11.270
Athena is special.

01:01:11.270 --> 01:01:15.030
I got it, Athena is special.

01:01:20.010 --> 01:01:23.640
Deunan, protect the Appleseed.

01:01:39.160 --> 01:01:41.970
I guess you know now, Deunan.

01:01:41.970 --> 01:01:45.080
Have you remembered where the data is?

01:01:47.580 --> 01:01:49.120
Carl's gun...

01:01:49.610 --> 01:01:53.310
The Appleseed data is in that pendant, right?

01:02:11.980 --> 01:02:13.800
You must be Dr. Gilliam.

01:02:14.270 --> 01:02:16.990
I'll have to ask you not to move, please.

01:02:22.340 --> 01:02:23.400
Don't move...

01:02:26.110 --> 01:02:28.120
For God's sake, please don't move!

01:02:31.190 --> 01:02:34.750
Mama? What's wrong, Mama?

01:02:34.750 --> 01:02:36.540
Deunan! Stay out!

01:02:38.000 --> 01:02:39.680
Don't shoot!

01:03:48.370 --> 01:03:49.680
Mom...

01:04:11.590 --> 01:04:13.840
This is bad. It's the Olympus Army.

01:04:13.840 --> 01:04:15.140
When did they get here?!

01:04:16.680 --> 01:04:18.490
How did they know about this place?

01:04:20.150 --> 01:04:21.840
There's lots of them.

01:04:21.840 --> 01:04:23.450
They have the downstairs secured already.

01:04:24.180 --> 01:04:26.020
There's only one way to the roof.

01:04:26.630 --> 01:04:28.270
We'll ambush them there!

01:04:33.410 --> 01:04:36.350
Whoops, nobody move, please.

01:04:38.730 --> 01:04:40.750
We're on the fifth floor, Lab D.

01:04:40.940 --> 01:04:42.440
Leyton, you...

01:04:43.040 --> 01:04:44.140
You traitor!

01:04:44.620 --> 01:04:47.270
I've always hated the Bioroids.

01:04:54.990 --> 01:04:58.350
Besides, the real traitor is right there.

01:05:01.360 --> 01:05:02.690
Hades!

01:05:03.370 --> 01:05:06.430
Deunan, it's been a long time.

01:05:07.380 --> 01:05:11.070
I only wish I could have killed Carl myself!

01:05:14.430 --> 01:05:17.880
As I thought, you stink of the Bioroids.

01:05:21.270 --> 01:05:27.540
It brings tears to my eyes to see you still hang out with your boyfriend, even though he's nothing but a machine now!

01:05:30.390 --> 01:05:34.170
I got fed up with those old fossils and their little terrorist farce.

01:05:34.680 --> 01:05:41.220
But you trusted your subordinates a little too much,
and that's the oldest mistake in the book, Briareos.

01:05:41.220 --> 01:05:43.670
Briareos, what's he talking about?

01:05:43.670 --> 01:05:45.890
I'll tell you, Deunan.

01:05:47.440 --> 01:05:50.420
The one behind the Care Center attack,

01:05:50.420 --> 01:05:51.910
was Briareos himself.

01:05:53.350 --> 01:05:58.980
You saw how he let my Landmate escape during the attack, didn't you?

01:05:58.980 --> 01:06:03.120
Thanks to him, every Bioroid is going to die!

01:06:03.560 --> 01:06:04.930
Is this true?

01:06:07.650 --> 01:06:11.970
Answer her, you damn Legislature lapdog!

01:06:20.500 --> 01:06:25.070
Now, hand over that pendant over to me.

01:06:38.580 --> 01:06:41.450
Deunan! Get to the roof!

01:06:41.450 --> 01:06:42.550
Hurry!

01:06:59.210 --> 01:06:59.810
Kudoh!

01:06:59.990 --> 01:07:01.170
Go!

01:07:28.020 --> 01:07:29.500
Stay back!

01:07:29.500 --> 01:07:31.600
Don't come any closer!

01:07:32.520 --> 01:07:35.720
Deunan, give me the pendant!

01:07:37.980 --> 01:07:40.810
You'll be safe if you do!

01:07:42.140 --> 01:07:44.940
My mother gave her life to protect this!

01:07:50.560 --> 01:07:54.020
You knew everything from the start, didn't you?

01:07:54.020 --> 01:07:55.700
You knew everything...

01:07:56.930 --> 01:07:58.040
Deunan...

01:08:04.320 --> 01:08:05.960
Deunan!

01:08:05.960 --> 01:08:09.600
Now you see what kind of monster he truly is!

01:08:17.900 --> 01:08:19.470
Deunan Knute!

01:08:20.370 --> 01:08:24.400
I'm Edward Uranus III, commander of the Olympus Regular Army.

01:08:25.240 --> 01:08:30.780
I'm a former comrade of Carl Knute and I knew Dr. Gilliam very well.

01:08:31.590 --> 01:08:34.440
We met many times when you were small.

01:08:35.250 --> 01:08:38.420
We don't wish to harm you.

01:08:39.050 --> 01:08:42.810
We just want to see that data destroyed.

01:08:47.840 --> 01:08:54.670
We're going to occupy the Legislature, destroy the D-Tank and all the Bioroids.

01:08:55.460 --> 01:09:00.060
Once again, human society will be returned to human hands.

01:09:00.810 --> 01:09:05.110
But that data threatens our coup d'état.

01:09:05.110 --> 01:09:08.980
Will you hand it over quietly?

01:09:10.600 --> 01:09:12.110
I refuse.

01:09:12.530 --> 01:09:13.710
Deunan!

01:09:17.300 --> 01:09:25.370
Deunan, Olympus is no longer the utopia that Carl and Dr. Gilliam dreamt of!

01:09:25.590 --> 01:09:30.220
All that my father Carl taught me to do was how to fight.

01:09:30.640 --> 01:09:38.380
But only now do I understand why he forged me into the battle machine I am today.

01:09:38.380 --> 01:09:41.640
General, as my mother instructed,

01:09:41.640 --> 01:09:43.940
I will hand this data over to Athena only!

01:09:44.420 --> 01:09:47.120
You can't trust the Bioroids!

01:09:47.780 --> 01:09:51.650
They want to control mankind.

01:09:51.650 --> 01:09:53.480
Maybe you're right.

01:09:53.480 --> 01:09:55.330
Maybe I can't trust them.

01:09:56.810 --> 01:09:59.710
But there's one thing I know for sure...

01:10:01.520 --> 01:10:04.360
Bioroids don't kill other Bioroids!

01:10:10.270 --> 01:10:13.720
General, you're wasting your time.

01:10:21.000 --> 01:10:22.520
Deunan...

01:10:23.420 --> 01:10:24.760
What a shame.

01:10:26.550 --> 01:10:29.330
Athena is trying to protect human society!

01:10:30.060 --> 01:10:35.680
Carl and Dr. Gilliam died hiding the Appleseed data to protect human society!

01:10:36.470 --> 01:10:39.290
They both feared what might happen when the Bioroids were activated.

01:10:40.370 --> 01:10:43.620
Because Bioroids represent a threat!

01:10:43.890 --> 01:10:46.960
That's wrong! Athena honored the doctor's wishes,

01:10:46.960 --> 01:10:49.850
and refused to fully activate their reproductive abilities.

01:10:53.980 --> 01:10:55.130
General...

01:10:57.960 --> 01:11:00.680
Bioroids are here to safeguard human society.

01:11:03.000 --> 01:11:06.330
I cooperated with Hades in that terrorist attack

01:11:06.330 --> 01:11:10.770
only to force Athena to fully activate the Bioroids.

01:11:13.050 --> 01:11:19.700
She kept hidden the key to revive the memories in you that the trauma had erased.

01:11:21.150 --> 01:11:25.750
My duty was to deliver Appleseed to the Elders.

01:11:27.260 --> 01:11:30.710
And in return, they would guarantee your safety.

01:11:31.860 --> 01:11:36.470
All the more reason we must destroy that pendant!

01:11:37.070 --> 01:11:40.380
General, don't you see something wrong with all this?!

01:11:40.380 --> 01:11:43.660
The Elders don't just want the Appleseed data!

01:11:44.720 --> 01:11:50.090
The Elders need a coup d'état.
They want to destroy the D-Tank!

01:11:52.810 --> 01:11:57.190
There must be a reason why Athena is so desperate to protect it.

01:11:57.850 --> 01:12:01.500
General, the D-Tank must not be destroyed!

01:12:06.560 --> 01:12:07.990
Briareos!

01:12:08.230 --> 01:12:13.010
I won't let some damned machine try to confuse us!

01:12:19.830 --> 01:12:22.220
This is vengeance, Deunan!

01:12:24.080 --> 01:12:31.170
You can't imagine the miserable days I suffered through
after your father kicked me out of L.A. S.W.A.T., Deunan!

01:12:31.170 --> 01:12:35.760
This is my revenge for Carl kicking me off the force!

01:12:36.230 --> 01:12:39.370
Even the fact that his DNA is inside them makes me sick!

01:12:40.320 --> 01:12:44.190
I'm going to kill every last Bioroid!

01:12:44.890 --> 01:12:46.210
Hades!

01:12:48.010 --> 01:12:52.780
Deunan, if you want to hate someone, hate your father!

01:13:58.900 --> 01:14:00.270
Forgive me...

01:14:02.380 --> 01:14:03.810
Don't speak.

01:14:05.490 --> 01:14:09.910
Even for a state-of-the-art cyborg, it still hurts to get shot.

01:14:10.840 --> 01:14:12.930
Please, don't talk!

01:14:16.070 --> 01:14:17.380
I missed you.

01:14:19.370 --> 01:14:25.310
As I lay dying on the battlefield, all I wanted was to see you again.

01:14:28.010 --> 01:14:30.930
And then the Elders saved me.

01:14:40.080 --> 01:14:46.120
I didn't care about anything else, only your safety.

01:14:46.120 --> 01:14:47.680
I know that now!

01:14:47.680 --> 01:14:52.630
And now I'm a monster, in body and soul.

01:14:52.630 --> 01:14:56.460
You haven't changed at all.
You're the same.

01:14:57.550 --> 01:15:02.960
But now I can no longer protect you.

01:15:03.930 --> 01:15:05.550
I won't let you die.

01:15:07.150 --> 01:15:10.080
Deunan, the Elders...

01:15:10.080 --> 01:15:11.520
Briareos!

01:15:17.580 --> 01:15:25.070
The Elders promised there would be no loss of human life,

01:15:25.070 --> 01:15:27.650
but something else is going on.

01:15:30.720 --> 01:15:32.850
That's why you have to go.

01:15:34.570 --> 01:15:37.170
But I can't just leave you!

01:15:38.860 --> 01:15:41.670
The future of this world is at stake!

01:15:42.010 --> 01:15:44.130
Why does the future matter if you're not in it?!

01:15:47.310 --> 01:15:48.310
Deunan...

01:15:49.200 --> 01:15:52.560
Don't let your mother's death be in vain.

01:15:53.740 --> 01:15:55.470
Stop trying to talk!

01:16:00.900 --> 01:16:01.970
Deunan...

01:16:03.220 --> 01:16:04.650
Briareos?

01:16:15.150 --> 01:16:17.330
Briareos!

01:17:43.940 --> 01:17:48.060
Briareos sent an SOS signal on a secret line just after he was shot!

01:18:00.420 --> 01:18:03.280
These Hecatonchires units are built like nothing else.

01:18:03.280 --> 01:18:05.070
His system shut down in time.

01:18:05.400 --> 01:18:07.230
I may still be able to save him.

01:18:09.010 --> 01:18:10.310
Save him!

01:18:11.910 --> 01:18:13.230
Please!

01:18:17.620 --> 01:18:19.250
It's got a full tank, so don't worry about that.

01:18:19.740 --> 01:18:25.080
The Landmate Damysos system was only recently put into general use, but you'll find it surprisingly stable in flight.

01:18:25.080 --> 01:18:29.750
It's a little top-heavy, but it shouldn't affect turns less than 60 degrees.

01:18:30.640 --> 01:18:31.330
Deunan...

01:18:33.140 --> 01:18:38.210
We Bioroids may not feel it as strongly as humans, but we do feel love.

01:18:41.910 --> 01:18:43.350
Save Hitomi.

01:19:31.460 --> 01:19:34.100
Deunan Knute, mission accomplished.

01:19:34.980 --> 01:19:36.100
Good work.

01:19:56.990 --> 01:19:57.990
Deunan...

01:20:47.290 --> 01:20:49.360
Deunan, well done!

01:20:49.360 --> 01:20:54.390
We've already perfected the Bioroid reproduction function!

01:20:54.870 --> 01:20:59.000
Hitomi's life support cycle is becoming like that of a human.

01:20:59.000 --> 01:21:01.410
Now she will be saved.

01:21:02.200 --> 01:21:03.680
Thank goodness...

01:21:06.290 --> 01:21:09.280
There's nothing to worry about anymore.

01:21:12.340 --> 01:21:13.480
Deunan?

01:21:16.800 --> 01:21:19.380
Was it you people who killed my mother?

01:21:24.020 --> 01:21:25.950
You killed her, didn't you?

01:21:32.250 --> 01:21:37.570
Deunan, forgive us.
It really was an accident.

01:21:37.570 --> 01:21:43.300
Had she been alive, we might have had other options.

01:21:43.300 --> 01:21:47.870
Why did my mother have to hide the Appleseed data?

01:21:48.010 --> 01:21:52.510
She gave us a glimmer of hope.

01:21:53.120 --> 01:21:57.760
A final chance for our human race to survive.

01:21:58.280 --> 01:22:05.460
That hope lay in human and Bioroid coexistence.

01:22:06.510 --> 01:22:12.010
But still, mankind's fighting didn't stop.

01:22:12.010 --> 01:22:15.420
Nor did its fear and hatred of alien races.

01:22:15.420 --> 01:22:18.560
It is about to overflow with anger and hatred.

01:22:18.560 --> 01:22:23.760
Humanity no longer has the ability to maintain this world.

01:22:23.760 --> 01:22:28.570
And it has ignored the doctor's vision.

01:22:29.430 --> 01:22:32.400
Gaia has made an accurate prediction

01:22:32.400 --> 01:22:39.420
that the human race is doomed to destroy itself and the world in three generations.

01:22:39.960 --> 01:22:41.390
Deunan...

01:22:42.620 --> 01:22:47.590
The time has come for us, the human race, to step aside.

01:22:48.060 --> 01:22:49.430
Step aside?

01:22:49.930 --> 01:22:56.340
We must relinquish the Earth's future to the Bioroids.

01:22:56.340 --> 01:23:03.690
The virus that Dr. Gilliam developed will finally serve its intended mission.

01:23:04.250 --> 01:23:06.260
The virus my mother developed?

01:23:11.590 --> 01:23:19.920
Yes, the virus sealed in the D-Tank, which has been sealed atop Tartaros all these years.

01:23:20.820 --> 01:23:23.180
That virus will...

01:23:24.930 --> 01:23:29.570
...render humans completely infertile!

01:23:31.840 --> 01:23:36.150
Not one human life will be taken.

01:23:36.150 --> 01:23:41.690
Instead, we will slowly close the book on human history.

01:23:42.470 --> 01:23:47.120
A mercy killing for the human race.

01:23:49.010 --> 01:23:51.030
My mother opposed you.

01:23:51.030 --> 01:23:54.790
She refused to fully activate Bioroid reproduction, so you killed her!

01:23:57.670 --> 01:24:02.080
The Olympus Plan had two options.

01:24:02.080 --> 01:24:07.120
Coexistence with the Bioroids or the transition to a new race.

01:24:07.970 --> 01:24:14.920
Gaia was built to render a fair and precise decision.

01:24:14.920 --> 01:24:21.250
Dr. Gilliam contributed greatly to Gaia's creation.

01:24:21.910 --> 01:24:27.070
Gaia certainly inherited the doctor's wish.

01:24:27.070 --> 01:24:33.520
The virus cannot be activated without Gaia's consent.

01:24:34.930 --> 01:24:45.840
But, once again, mankind started a global war and reduced the world to ruins.

01:24:48.220 --> 01:24:54.230
And even Olympus, which was intended to control the world, is threatened as well.

01:24:58.100 --> 01:25:05.910
The hatred of Bioroids, which General Uranus's group showed, fueled Gaia's anger.

01:25:08.080 --> 01:25:12.680
Thus, Gaia rendered its decision

01:25:12.680 --> 01:25:19.590
to use the Appleseed to create a new race from the Bioroids,

01:25:19.590 --> 01:25:22.870
and for humanity to vanish from the planet.

01:25:23.730 --> 01:25:25.300
You used us.

01:25:27.820 --> 01:25:31.770
I was the bait for you to use Briareos.

01:25:35.520 --> 01:25:38.580
It was all done to force Gaia's decision!

01:25:38.580 --> 01:25:40.300
All to deceive Gaia!

01:25:40.820 --> 01:25:43.720
It is mankind's destiny, Deunan!

01:25:45.410 --> 01:25:53.060
When I press this button, the D-tank atop Tartaros will detonate and release the virus, which will envelop the Earth.

01:25:58.730 --> 01:26:00.790
Hold it, Old Man!

01:26:02.690 --> 01:26:04.920
Cut power to 9A4G.

01:26:04.920 --> 01:26:07.580
That button is now inactive.

01:26:08.420 --> 01:26:10.950
What are you doing, Athena?

01:26:12.120 --> 01:26:17.100
Have you forgotten that Bioroids were made to ensure mankind's survival?

01:26:17.480 --> 01:26:22.840
Bioroids aren't programmed to disobey humans, either.

01:26:22.840 --> 01:26:25.410
We're no longer Bioroid.

01:26:25.410 --> 01:26:28.100
Please call us the new race of man.

01:26:28.510 --> 01:26:32.250
Athena, this is Gaia's wish.

01:26:32.250 --> 01:26:38.250
Its anger at Uranus' revolt and punishment for mankind's sins...

01:26:38.250 --> 01:26:44.470
General Uranus has abandoned his plans for a coup d'état and has just requested a reconciliation.

01:26:45.960 --> 01:26:47.310
The General did?

01:26:47.790 --> 01:26:52.090
I'm sure Gaia knows about it.

01:26:53.630 --> 01:26:57.860
Deunan, Gaia's will is not present in this room.

01:26:57.860 --> 01:26:59.510
It's not?

01:27:00.300 --> 01:27:04.310
If it were, it would have reversed the Elder's decision,
since the humans' hatred of the Bioroids has weakened.

01:27:05.230 --> 01:27:10.310
They shut Gaia down and have been acting on their own.

01:27:10.710 --> 01:27:13.190
Impressive, Athena.

01:27:13.190 --> 01:27:17.330
The new race of man is, indeed, magnificent!

01:27:17.650 --> 01:27:23.580
Shutting down Gaia will have a terrible effect on your life support systems, won't it?

01:27:23.730 --> 01:27:29.890
Correct, we intend to perish with mankind.

01:27:58.460 --> 01:28:00.920
T-The Mobile Fortress platforms...

01:28:15.060 --> 01:28:20.880
T-The Mobile Fortress platforms have all activated and are marching en masse towards the center of Olympus!

01:28:23.890 --> 01:28:28.270
The Mobile Fortress platforms are heading for the top of Tartaros!

01:28:28.680 --> 01:28:31.770
No one can stop them now.

01:28:53.770 --> 01:28:55.820
To all ES.W.A.T. Units!

01:28:55.820 --> 01:29:00.510
Equip all Landmates with Damysos systems and attack from all directions!

01:29:00.510 --> 01:29:02.320
You have to stop them, no matter what!

01:29:05.180 --> 01:29:07.850
The D-Tank security system is perfect, right?

01:29:07.850 --> 01:29:11.540
Hypothetically, a pointblank shot from the main guns on a Mobile Fortress could penetrate it.

01:29:11.540 --> 01:29:15.010
The ultimate sword versus the perfect shield.

01:29:15.440 --> 01:29:18.280
Such is the tragedy of those who cling to power!

01:29:18.660 --> 01:29:21.800
At current speed, they will reach Tartaros in fifteen minutes.

01:29:22.580 --> 01:29:23.550
Can we evacuate the civilians?

01:29:23.550 --> 01:29:24.990
The police are trying as hard as they can.

01:29:24.990 --> 01:29:26.520
That's the top priority!

01:29:26.520 --> 01:29:29.800
Once they're in an unpopulated area, we can launch an all-out attack.

01:29:29.800 --> 01:29:34.350
Platform 7 is the control node for
all the other Mobile Fortresses.

01:29:34.350 --> 01:29:35.480
Hitomi!

01:29:36.690 --> 01:29:37.820
Hitomi?

01:29:38.560 --> 01:29:41.290
I'm sorry, Elders.

01:29:41.870 --> 01:29:49.550
If someone can disable the control box on the frontal cortex of Platform 7, it will shut them all down.

01:29:49.550 --> 01:29:51.710
You can't just destroy it!

01:29:52.510 --> 01:29:55.760
Platform 7 has to be shut down manually.

01:29:56.570 --> 01:30:00.190
The shutdown password is "HITOMI".

01:30:11.710 --> 01:30:12.900
Briareos!

01:30:13.560 --> 01:30:15.210
Deunan, I kept my promise!

01:30:15.580 --> 01:30:18.820
Deunan, let's go! Jump!

01:30:20.690 --> 01:30:22.060
It's too late!

01:30:22.060 --> 01:30:24.760
Mankind is doomed to destroy the Earth!

01:30:25.030 --> 01:30:28.760
Deunan, Eden has been lost to us!

01:30:32.390 --> 01:30:35.520
So, you'd let it all end with us passing on our sins to the new race?

01:30:37.940 --> 01:30:42.140
Even if we've lost Eden, we have to try to survive.

01:30:43.240 --> 01:30:46.030
To try and grasp the future ourselves!

01:31:06.400 --> 01:31:07.210
Deunan!

01:32:07.980 --> 01:32:09.940
No good! There's no blind spot!

01:32:10.610 --> 01:32:13.950
Platforms are now 2,000 meters from Tartaros!

01:32:21.840 --> 01:32:23.950
Our weapons are having no effect.

01:32:25.700 --> 01:32:28.850
Commander Lance, I'm going to jump onto Platform 7. Cover me!

01:32:37.440 --> 01:32:38.600
Which one's Platform 7?

01:32:39.020 --> 01:32:40.150
The one in the middle.

01:32:43.980 --> 01:32:46.560
Flank Platforms 6 and 8 and aim for the legs.

01:32:46.560 --> 01:32:48.360
What about Platform 5 in front?

01:32:48.360 --> 01:32:52.230
It doesn't matter. Concentrate all fire on Platforms 6 and 8!

01:33:37.910 --> 01:33:39.170
Platform 6 is down!

01:33:39.170 --> 01:33:41.700
Good. What about Platform 8?

01:34:09.470 --> 01:34:10.360
There it is.

01:34:12.070 --> 01:34:14.950
I'll distract it. Deunan, go in low from its feet!

01:34:15.430 --> 01:34:16.470
Got it!

01:34:34.100 --> 01:34:35.100
Briareos!

01:34:41.370 --> 01:34:41.970
Deunan!

01:35:36.000 --> 01:35:38.060
A platform has reached Tartaros!

01:35:38.530 --> 01:35:39.940
It's starting to climb it!

01:36:18.160 --> 01:36:19.450
Deunan, we're running out of time!

01:36:26.100 --> 01:36:28.650
Three platforms are near the D-Tank!

01:36:28.650 --> 01:36:30.630
We can't hold them off any longer!

01:36:58.440 --> 01:36:59.600
Why?!

01:37:04.430 --> 01:37:05.720
What's wrong?!

01:37:19.140 --> 01:37:20.170
Briareos!

01:37:38.860 --> 01:37:41.200
Deunan, let go of my hand!

01:37:41.200 --> 01:37:43.230
Like hell I am!

01:38:02.800 --> 01:38:04.800
Hurry and input the password!

01:38:22.280 --> 01:38:23.150
Mom...

01:38:47.230 --> 01:38:48.530
They've stopped...

01:39:08.210 --> 01:39:11.940
All platforms have shut down.
The D-Tank is secure!

01:39:34.600 --> 01:39:35.990
Briareos!

01:39:54.830 --> 01:39:55.950
Deunan!

01:39:56.250 --> 01:39:57.610
Hitomi!

01:39:58.210 --> 01:39:59.580
Ow, ow, ow...

01:40:01.470 --> 01:40:02.850
Are the Elders...?

01:40:10.560 --> 01:40:14.930
I see, but the last letter of the password...

01:40:15.510 --> 01:40:16.920
It's been left to us.

01:40:19.410 --> 01:40:21.350
It's all been left to us.

01:40:57.590 --> 01:41:00.080
Nothing was really changed, in the end.

01:41:00.810 --> 01:41:04.480
And if nothing does change,

01:41:04.480 --> 01:41:07.340
perhaps the sins of mankind will only deepen.

01:41:09.040 --> 01:41:11.760
Even so, I will fight on.

01:41:12.900 --> 01:41:18.830
For the sake of our children, the true "new race of man".
